  "answer": "[1] calc/calc.go:19-23 (Machine.Push)\n// Push adds n to the running total and returns it. CODETRAILDOC.\nfunc (m *Machine) Push(n int) int {\n\tm.total += n\n\treturn m.total\n}\n\n[2] calc/use.go:3-10 (Total)\n// Total renders a machine after pushing every n. CODETRAILDOC.\nfunc Total(ns []int) string {\n\tm := \u0026Machine{}\n\tfor _, n := range ns {\n\t\tm.Push(n)\n\t}\n\treturn Render(m)\n}\n\n[3] calc/calc.go:14-17 (Machine)\n// Machine accumulates a running total. CODETRAILDOC.\ntype Machine struct {\n\ttotal int\n}",
